OL,3,GNEWSABiker jailed over fatal collision
OL,4,Awith pedestrian
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn unlicensed motorcyclist has been
OL,7,Fjailed for killing a pedestrian in a
OL,8,Fcollision on the A6110 ring road in
OL,9,FLeeds.
OL,11,FReece Manley was riding a Kawasaki
OL,12,Fmotorbike when he hit 75-year-old Alan
OL,13,FLloyd as he crossed the road on 26
OL,14,FMarch 2022.
OL,16,FThe 26-year-old denied causing death by
OL,17,Fdangerous driving but, during a trial
OL,18,Fat Leeds Crown Court in August, he
OL,19,Fadmitted an alternate charge of causing
OL,20,Fdeath by careless driving.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
