OL,3,GNEWSABiker jailed over fatal collision
OL,4,Awith pedestrian
OL,5,
OL,6,FManley, of Welford Road, in Filey, also
OL,7,Fadmitted driving without the relevant
OL,8,Flicence and insurance and was jailed on
OL,9,FWednesday for 14 months. He was also
OL,10,Fbanned from driving for three years and
OL,11,Fseven months.
